flowchart LR
  accTitle: Account-aware quoting with explicit controls
  accDescr: Emails and attachments are classified and parsed for parts. Account, inventory, and open-quote context feed policy checks. Requests can proceed to quote routing or human review, and accepted quotes connect to orders.
  input["RFQ intake"] --> extract["Extract<br/>parts"]
  extract --> context["Account<br/>context"]
  context --> policy{"Policy<br/>checks"}
  policy -->|Pass| quote["Quote<br/>routing"]
  policy -->|Exception| human["Human<br/>review"]
  human --> quote
  quote --> order["Accepted quote<br/>to order"]
  class context,policy focus
  class human human
